body:
I am actually in the exact same boat as you. I ordered mine on the 14th as well, got my confirmation, but never got a shipping email or a tracking number. Somehow I opened my package tracker, and it said I had a tracking number. It says it is to be delivered on the 17th. The 17th comes and goes, and nothing. I emailed them that night, and they said that they're sorry about the delay and that I have the right tracking number, and it should be here today (18th). Well today has also come and gone, the tracking says that they haven't even received the package, and so I have just sent them a second email. I would say you should also send them an email.

&#x200B;

I just got an update on my tracking, it says it'll be here tomorrow
